  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6253f00e-8026-46b3-a023-5f2f2a102f07",
    "name": "Partner Programs API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Programs (formerly known as Campaigns) are the brand partnerships that drive your earnings on impact.com. When a brand approves your application, you get a Program — a configured relationship with payout terms, tracking links, ad creatives, and a catalog of products you can promote.\n\nNote that the URL path uses `/Campaigns` even though the concept is now called \"Programs\" — this is preserved for backwards compatibility.\n\nUse this API to:\n\n1. **List your programs** to discover which brands you partner with.\n2. **Retrieve a program** for full details including tracking links, deep-linking permissions, and contract status.\n3. **Retrieve the program logo** for display in your storefront or content.\n\nEach program references your **Contract** (see the Partner Contracts API) and provides the **TrackingLink** used to drive attributed traffic.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: impact.com Developer Support",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
